## Instructions for Local Execution

1. Make sure to populate your real Datalab API key in the [.env](file:///d:/BillBotAI/.env) file:
   ```env
   CHANDRA_API_KEY=your_real_datalab_api_key
   ```
2. Start the FastAPI server using the Python virtual environment:
   ```powershell
   venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn backend.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
   ```
3. Open the frontend next app or trigger invoice processing from the UI. The real Chandra layout OCR pipeline will execute natively!
